stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> reviewed : submit for review
    reviewed --> accepted : approve
    reviewed --> draft : send back
    accepted --> reviewed : periodic re-review
    accepted --> expired : review date passes
    expired --> draft : re-open
    expired --> reviewed : re-review

    note right of accepted
        Segregation of duties:
        nothing goes straight
        from draft to accepted.
    end note
    note right of expired
        Time-driven: an accepted
        control auto-reads as
        expired once next_review
        is in the past.
    end note
